{
  "schema": "polaris.local.v1",
  "active_project": "venusws63",
  "description": "Polaris 本机基础配置。新用户复制为 polaris.local.json 后，只改串口、声卡、Wi-Fi、唤醒词和云环境。",
  "common": {
    "audio": {
      "default_playback_device_key": "",
      "device_key_policy": "留空时使用电脑默认播放声卡；多声卡或指定声卡测试时填写 laid/listenai-play 扫描到的稳定 key。",
      "playback_volume": 80,
      "capture_device_key": "",
      "loopback_device_key": "",
      "capture_device_name": "",
      "capture_sample_rate": 16000,
      "capture_channels": 1,
      "capture_duration_s": 5,
      "acoustic_oracle": {
        "thresholds": {
          "active_threshold_dbfs": -50,
          "min_rms_dbfs": -45,
          "min_peak_dbfs": -35,
          "min_active_duration_ms": 300,
          "max_clip_ratio": 0.01
        }
      }
    },
    "device": {
      "wake_word": "小美小美",
      "wakeup_id": "xiao mei xiao mei",
      "iot_id": ""
    },
    "network": {
      "wifi_ssid": "",
      "wifi_password": "",
      "enable_hotspot_control": false
    },
    "timeouts": {
      "observe_ms": 15000,
      "recognition_timeout_s": 15,
      "half_duplex_timeout_s": 15,
      "full_duplex_timeout_s": 60,
      "timing_guard_ms": 1200,
      "wake_cluster_gap_ms": 2500,
      "interrupt_guard_ms": 600,
      "post_injection_ms": 5000,
      "post_recovery_ms": 60000
    },
    "paths": {
      "command_file": "docs/fa2命令词.txt",
      "debug_root": "satellite/cucumber-agent-testing/debug",
      "result_root": "result"
    }
  },
  "projects": {
    "cskwb01": {
      "project_type": "wb01",
      "assertion_profile": "cp_ap_asr_three_port",
      "serial": {
        "topology": "csk_ap_cp_wb01_control",
        "baudrate": 115200,
        "ports": {
          "ap": "COM14",
          "cp": "COM12",
          "asr": "COM13",
          "control": "COM15"
        },
        "control_preconditions": [
          "uut-pa.on",
          "pa-enable.set 0 17 0 1"
        ]
      },
      "network": {
        "wifi_ssid": "pcwifi24",
        "wifi_password": "12345678",
        "enable_hotspot_control": true
      },
      "cloud": {
        "api_environment": "sit",
        "device_env": "sit",
        "device_env_command": "flash.set.int env@2",
        "device_env_reboot_required": true,
        "capabilities": [],
        "device_id": ""
      },
      "notes": [
        "WB01/CSK 三端项目需要 AP、CP、ASR/WB01、控制口 4 个串口。",
        "执行 API/云控前，CSK/AP 设备端环境必须和 cloud.api_environment 一致。",
        "如果声卡播放成功但设备无唤醒证据，先在控制口执行 PA 前置：uut-pa.on、pa-enable.set 0 17 0 1；命令必须发到 control 串口。"
      ]
    },
    "venusws63": {
      "project_type": "ws63",
      "assertion_profile": "ap_upper_no_cp",
      "serial": {
        "topology": "ap_wifi_control_no_cp",
        "baudrate": 921600,
        "control_baudrate": 115200,
        "ports": {
          "ap": "COM14",
          "upper": "COM13",
          "asr": "COM13",
          "cp": "",
          "control": "COM15"
        },
        "control_preconditions": [
          "uut-pa.on",
          "pa-enable.set 0 17 0 1"
        ]
      },
      "cloud": {
        "api_environment": "uat",
        "device_env": "uat",
        "device_env_command": "flash.set.int env@1",
        "device_env_reboot_required": true,
        "version_gate": {
          "authorized_versions": [
            "35.03.01.01.18.26.05.04.00.01"
          ],
          "unauthorized_versions": [
            "35.03.01.01.18.26.05.04.00.02"
          ]
        },
        "capabilities": [],
        "device_id": ""
      },
      "notes": [
        "WS63/AP+WiFi 项目没有独立 CP 串口，cp 必须留空。",
        "PA 相关命令走控制口，不要发到 AP 或上位/WiFi 口。",
        "云控 API 不生效时先用 tools/cloud/polaris_cloud_diagnostics.py 检查 Project Version、UAT/SIT 环境和业务码。"
      ]
    }
  }
}
